WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.440
Lab 2 runs a real leaver, in a test
tenant with Microsoft Entra ID

2
00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:09.337
Governance licenses and a test Azure
subscription, never production.

3
00:00:09.337 --> 00:00:12.599
You need the Lifecycle
Workflows Administrator role,

4
00:00:12.599 --> 00:00:16.801
and Logic App Contributor, Contributor
or Owner on the resource group.

5
00:00:16.801 --> 00:00:20.221
Create the extension and its
Logic App in the admin center,

6
00:00:20.221 --> 00:00:24.212
record what the admin center made,
and check it against the registry.

7
00:00:24.212 --> 00:00:26.774
Replace the definition with the program's.

8
00:00:26.774 --> 00:00:30.671
Build an on-demand test leaver
workflow that blocks first,

9
00:00:30.671 --> 00:00:32.863
and run it for one fictional user.

10
00:00:32.863 --> 00:00:34.549
Then drill the failure path:

11
00:00:34.549 --> 00:00:38.362
point the integration at a receiver
that answers five-oh-three,

12
00:00:38.362 --> 00:00:42.762
and confirm the task ends failed within
minutes, not at the end of the hour.

13
00:00:42.762 --> 00:00:47.632
To back it out, remove the custom task
and the workflow, then the extension,

14
00:00:47.632 --> 00:00:52.501
the Logic App, the resource group, the
role assignments and the test users.

15
00:00:52.501 --> 00:00:54.720
The authors haven't run Lab 2.
